# The deliverable lives in deliver/ and IS committed on purpose: this project has already lost
# its render twice to a sandbox reset, and an artefact nobody can play is not a deliverable.
# Working files under out/ stay out of git (they are regenerable and large).
out/*.mp4
out/*.wav
out/*.m4a
out/*.json
# QA sheets and stills are artefacts too — regenerate with `node render.mjs --stills`
out/*.png
out/poster.jpg
out/.audio/
out/stills/
out/voice/
# a 50 MB static ffmpeg is fetched, not committed (see tools/README.md)
tools/ffmpeg
tools/ffmpeg-*
# 63MB neural voices: fetched automatically by piper-voice.mjs
voices/*.onnx
voices/*.tar.gz
